{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/hillsedge-emaar-properties-dubai-hills-estate","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":110,"crm_id":"3803","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Hillsedge","slug":"hillsedge-emaar-properties-dubai-hills-estate","display_address":"Dubai Hills Estate","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":1840000,"display_price":"1.84M","lattitude":25.1154657,"longitude":55.268333,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Following Tower A's successful launch, Emaar Properties unveiled Hillsedge Tower B at Dubai Hills Estate, enhancing the luxurious offerings of this sought-after development. Tower A features <strong>204 one-bedroom units and 202 two-bedroom apartments, </strong>while Tower B introduces another 406 residences, comprising <strong>204 one-bedroom and 202 two-bedroom apartments.</strong></p><p>Emaar Hillsedge Residences at Dubai Hills Estate boast expansive floor-to-ceiling windows, framing stunning views of Dubai Hills Park and the city skyline. As part of the master-planned Mohammed Bin Rashid (MBR) City, the development offers seamless connectivity to key attractions via Al Khail Road. The interiors are thoughtfully crafted with modern finishes, bespoke furnishings, and spacious layouts, creating a bright and comfortable living environment.</p><p>Residents enjoy world-class amenities, including swimming pools, a yoga deck, a kids' play area, and an indoor gym. Additionally, Hillside Park, located just minutes away, provides recreational options like sports courts, cove seating, and a skate bowl.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Hillsedge_at_Dubai_Hills_Estate_by_Emaar_Properties_Dubai_be3308dc78.jpg","hash":"Hillsedge_at_Dubai_Hills_Estate_by_Em