tate by Emaar Properties Dubai"},"style":null,"title":"Hillsedge at Dubai Hills Estate – Where Serenity Meets Vibrant Living","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Prime Location: Nestled in Dubai Hills Estate, offering seamless access to Downtown Dubai, Dubai Marina, and key destinations via Al Khail Road.</li><li>Breathtaking Views: Stunning vistas of Dubai Hills Park and the city skyline from every home, adding a touch of luxury to daily life.</li><li>Spacious, Modern Interiors: Thoughtfully designed 1 and 2-bedroom apartments with expansive floor plans, floor-to-ceiling windows, and premium finishes.</li><li>Seamless Connectivity: Easy access to key hotspots, including Dubai Hills Mall (5 minutes), Downtown Dubai (10 minutes), and Dubai Marina (10 minutes).</li><li>Comprehensive Amenities: Includes adult and kids' swimming pools, indoor/outdoor gyms, multi-level play areas, sports courts, yoga deck, and more.</li><li>Natural Serenity: Surrounded by lush parks, green spaces, and family-friendly recreational areas, offering a peaceful, balanced lifestyle within the city.</li><li>Developer Reputation: Developed by Emaar Properties, known for delivering world-class, high-qualitydevelopments in prime locations.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1253,"cta":{"id":2019,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Hillsedge_at_Dubai_Hills_Estate_by_Emaar_Properties_Dubai_6b02df7384.jpg","hash":"Hillsedge_at_Dubai_Hills_Estate_by_Emaar_Properties_Dubai_6b02df7384","name":"Hillsedge at Dubai Hills Estate by Emaar Properties Dubai"},"style":null,"title":"Experience Luxurious Living in Dubai Hills Estate's Prestigious Golf Community","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Hillsedge is ideally located in the heart of Dubai Hills Estate, offering unmatched connectivity to Downtown Dubai, Dubai Marina, and key landmarks. Situated along Al Khail Road, Dubai Hills Estate is an integral part of Mohammed Bin Rashid City. Residents enjoy proximity to world-class amenities like Dubai Hills Mall, the Golf Club, and top schools, all within a serene, green environment. With expansive parks and family-friendly spaces, Emaar Hillsedge Residences provides the perfect balance of city convenience and tranquil living.</p><ul><li>05 Minutes to Dubai Hills Mall</li><li>10 Minutes to Downtown Dubai</li><li>10 Minutes to Dubai Marina</li><li>12 Minutes to the Mall of the Emirates</li><li>15 Minutes to Dubai Mall and Burj Khalifa</li><li>15 Minutes to Burj Al Arab</li><li>15 Minutes to Dubai International Airport</li><li>25 Minutes to Al Maktoum International Airport</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3434,"url":null,"file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Brochure_83e391548b.pdf","hash":"Brochure_83e391548b","name":"Brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":2155,"thumbnail":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Hillsedge_at_Dubai_Hills_Estate_by_Emaar_Properties_Dubai_6e742ef522.jpg","hash":"Hillsedge_at_Dubai_Hills_Estate_by_Emaar_Properties_Dubai_6e742ef522","name":"Hillsedge at Dubai Hills Estate by Emaar Properties Dubai"},"video_url":"https://youtube.com/watch?v=DSTUm6zLBfI"},"floor_plans":[{"id":3059,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"708 sq. ft. ","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Hillsedge_at_Dubai_Hills_Estate_by_Emaar_Properties_Dubai_492f58515e.jpg","hash":"Hillsedge_at_Dubai_Hills_Estate_by_Emaar_Properties_Dubai_492f58515e","name":"Hillsedge at Dubai Hills Estate by Emaar Properties Dubai"},"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3060,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"1095 sq. ft. ","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Hillsedge_at_Dubai_Hills_Estate_by_Emaar_Properties_Dubai_65060cd2b0.jpg","hash":"Hillsedge_at_Dubai_Hills_Estate_by_Emaar_Properties_Dubai_65060cd2b0","name":"Hillsedge at Dubai Hills Estate by Emaar Properties Dubai"},"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"80/20","payment_plans":[{"id":9029,"title":"10%","description":"Down Payment"},{"id":9030,"title":"70%","description":"During Construction"},{"id":9031,"title":"20%","description":"On Handover"}],"community":"Dubai Hills Estate","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":19364,"url":null,"text":"Indoor and Outdoor Gyms","type":null,"image":null},{"id":19365,"url":null,"text":"Adult & Kids Swimming Pools","type":null,"image":null},{"id":19366,"url":null,"text":"Multi-level Kids’ Play Areas","type":null,"image":null},{"id":19367,"url":null,"text":"Sports Courts & Jogging Tracks","type":null,"image":null},{"id":19368,"url":null,"text":"Yoga Deck & Parkour Area","type":null,"image":null},{"id":19369,"url":null,"text":"Skate Bowl & Mini-Golf","type":null,"image":null},{"id":19370,"url":null,"text":"Dry Fountains & Art Elements","type":null,"image":null},{"id":19371,"url":null,"text":"Outdoor Cinema & Amphitheatre","type":null,"image":null}],"bitrix":{"id":1079,"pf_id":"are.3.14761","source":null,"project_id":"Dubai Hills","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Hillsedge","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":"Dubai Hills Estate"},"banner_image_mobile":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Hillsedge_at_Dubai_Hills_Estate_by_Emaar_Properties_Dubai_8776cb86e1.jpg","hash":"Hillsedge_at_Dubai_Hills_Estate_by_Emaar_Properties_Dubai_8776cb86e1","name":"Hillsedge at Dubai Hills Estate by Emaar Properties Dubai"},"seo":{"id":1449,"metaTitle":"Hillsedge at Dubai Hills Estate by Emaar Properties Dubai","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Discover Hillsedge at Dubai Hills Estate – luxurious 1 & 2-bedroom apartments with stunning views, premium finishes, and a flexible payment plan. Live the dream!\n"},"more_info":[{"id":4928,"answer":"<p>Hillsedge at Dubai Hills Estate by Emaar is a premium residential development offering modern one —and two-bedroom apartments. The project combines luxurious living with stunning views of Dubai Hills Park and the city skyline. It is located in MBR City and features contemporary architecture, spacious layouts, and world-class amenities, making it a top choice for modern living and investment.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is Hillsedge at Dubai Hills Estate by Emaar?"},{"id":4929,"answer":"<p>Tower B at Hillsedge by Emaar builds on the success of Tower A by introducing an additional 406 premium units, comprising 204 one-bedroom apartments and 202 two-bedroom apartments. While both towers share luxurious features such as floor-to-ceiling windows, modern finishes, and stunning views of Dubai Hills Park and the city skyline, Tower B benefits from enhanced layouts and optimized designs tailored to meet the needs of modern residents. Tower B also expands the community, offering more opportunities for individuals and families to experience the world-class amenities, seamless connectivity, and tranquil lifestyle that make Hillsedge a standout development.</p>","question":"What is the difference between Hillsedge Tower B and Tower A?"},{"id":4930,"answer":"<p>Hillsedge offers spacious 1-bedroom apartments starting from 708 sq. ft. and 2-bedroom apartments starting from 1,095 sq. ft. Both Tower A and Tower B residences feature expansive layouts, large windows, and high-quality interiors designed for a comfortable, modern living experience.</p>","question":"What floor plans are available at Hillsedge?"},{"id":4931,"answer":"<p>Hillsedge by Emaar provides premium amenities, including adult and kids’ swimming pools, multi-level play areas, sports courts, an indoor gym, a yoga deck, and more. Nearby, Hillside Park offers recreational facilities such as mini-golf, an outdoor cinema, cove seating, and a skate bowl, ensuring a balanced lifestyle for residents.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities are available at Hillsedge by Emaar?"},{"id":4932,"answer":"<p>Hillsedge by Emaar offers a flexible 80/20 payment plan. Buyers pay 80% during the construction phase and 20% upon handover, making it an attractive option for those looking to invest in luxury real estate.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"How does the payment plan for Hillsedge by Emaar work?"},{"id":4933,"answer":"<p>Hillsedge by Emaar is situated in Dubai Hills Estate, a prime location within MBR City. It provides seamless connectivity to major destinations, including Dubai Hills Mall (5 minutes), Downtown Dubai (10 minutes), and Burj Khalifa (15 minutes). The location also ensures easy access to Dubai Marina, Dubai International Airport, and other key areas.</p>","question":"Where is Hillsedge by Emaar located, and what are the nearby attractions?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":[],"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":null,"src_cftle":"i/off-plan/3803/images/i/Hillsedge_at_Dubai_Hills_Estate_by_Emaar_Properties_Dubai_fdc43795fc.jpg","transforms":[]},{"src_url":null,"src_cftle":"i/off-plan/3803/images/i/Hillsedge_at_Dubai_Hills_Estate_by_Emaar_Properties_Dubai_185227c0b0.jpg","transforms":[]},{"src_url":null,"src_cftle":"i/off-plan/3803/images/i/Hillsedge_at_Dubai_Hills_Estate_by_Emaar_Properties_Dubai_fe957a13ed.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/off-plan/3803/im